res et à la culture, dispose de 215 places assises et propose de septembre à juin une programmation pluridisciplinaire (théâtre, danse, musique et cirque).","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Museum_of_the_History_of_Polish_Jews_in_Warsaw_Main_exhibition_Gwo%C5%BAdziec_synagogue.jpg/960px-Museum_of_the_History_of_Polish_Jews_in_Warsaw_Main_exhibition_Gwo%C5%BAdziec_synagogue.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Illustration · Magdalena Starowieyska, Dariusz Golik, CC BY-SA 3.0 pl","photoGeneric":true},{"id":"dt-place-a025f3e1-f7e3-3c03-bd76-61f8e816bf06","isPlace":true,"scene":"village","city":"evreux","category":"À voir","title":"Domaine de Courtmoulin","date":null,"time":"","place":"19 Rue de Gaillon, Le Val d'Hazey","lat":49.1612014,"lng":1.3181964,"price":"Voir sur place","thumb":"","source":"datatourisme","createdAt":1791341135179,"description":"Venez flâner librement dans le parc du domaine de Courtmoulin et découvrez sa chapelle, classée Monument Historique depuis 2006, son étang, ses animaux, son verger, son pigeonnier et encore pleins d'autres choses !","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Entr%C3%A9e_du_ch%C3%A2teau_de_Courtmoulin_-_RD_6105_-_SBSG_0886.jpg/960px-Entr%C3%A9e_du_ch%C3%A2teau_de_Courtmoulin_-_RD_6105_-_SBSG_0886.jpg?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Wikimedia Commons"},{"id":"osm-place-way-82068321","isPlace":true,"scene":"village","city":"evreux","category":"À voir","title":"Château de Trangis","date":null,"time":"","place":"Évreux","lat":49.008735,"lng":1.145833,"price":"Voir sur place","thumb":"","source":"openstreetmap","createdAt":1791236442748,"description":"Monument historique référencé sur OpenStreetMap.","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Chateau_Frontenac_illuminated_at_night_in_Quebec_City.jpg/960px-Chateau_Frontenac_illuminated_at_ni